WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Meet DeepsGuard360, an integrated security management platform for Papua New Guinea and the Pacific.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Bring guard profiles, workforce schedules, GPS visibility and patrol management together.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Coordinate incident response, control room workflows and simulated CCTV views in one place.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Give clients restricted access to their own sites, attendance and reports.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Scale across isolated company workspaces with subscription options for every team size.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.000
DeepsGuard360. One platform. Complete security operations. Developed and powered by Deeps Systems.
